flowchart TB
  accTitle: 3 — Audits, monitoring and reviewed improvement
  accDescr: Independently selected audits produce complete reference labels when conclusive. Diagnostic monitoring supports reviewed training requests. Qualified model releases return to nightly scoring.

  AUDIT["Independent 5%<br/>full-battery sampling"]
  WORK(["To 2 · Required<br/>audit procedures"])
  FINDINGS(["From 2 · Completed<br/>qualified audit findings"])
  LABELS["Complete audited labels<br/>Incomplete audits stay pending"]
  FEATURES(["From 1 · Versioned<br/>feature snapshots"])
  SIGNALS(["Batch health + input validity<br/>Diagnostic outcomes + audit status"])
  MON["Data and model<br/>performance monitoring"]
  TRAIN["Reviewed candidate request<br/>Offline training + evaluation"]
  REVIEW["Human review<br/>and release qualification"]
  RELEASE(["To 1 · Qualified<br/>versioned model"])

  AUDIT --> WORK
  WORK -. "after audit procedures" .-> FINDINGS
  FINDINGS --> LABELS --> TRAIN
  FEATURES --> TRAIN
  SIGNALS --> MON --> TRAIN
  TRAIN --> REVIEW --> RELEASE

